{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-8b0414053b4b246a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Next, launch the code-reviewer subagent. Per the spawn instructions: \"Read the enumerated agent files with the Read tool, then launch the subagent, passing the entire content of that file as the subagent's prompt.\" Also, the Agent tool instructions state: do not set the model field. (The agent file frontmatter says `model: sonnet`, but I must not pass model — the contract states never to set a model.)\n\nThe prompt should be the entire content of the agent file + the task. The task: review the committed changes for STORY-setup-001a (root package.json + test/package.test.cjs, commit 6cc5d66) against the acceptance criteria.\n\nAlright, let's launch it.\n","signature":"ac6475f8094d47d098743a6f5df457bb"}],"model":"unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":57458,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a79ed400-e19f-485b-9cf9-abd863d235e9","uuid":"b1c0324c-00cc-4651-bac2-5ff6615e7aee","timestamp":"2026-08-20T11:09:58.458Z"}
